---

## Summary

| Area | Status | Priority |
|------|--------|----------|
| Mock URLs | Unrealistic | Medium |
| Findings per Pillar | Too sparse (2-3 avg) | High |
| Type completeness | 85% complete | Low |
| Scoring logic | Very basic | High |
| Tailwind animations | 60% coverage | Medium |

**Most critical gap:** The scoring system is too simplistic for a real CRO tool. It needs weighted pillars, impact estimation, device context, and comparative benchmarking.
